data.content:
The diff was reviewed (src/notify.js). The new parallel logic is incorrect: `forEach` doesn’t await async calls, causing `markNotified` to run too early and errors to be missed. Replace the loop with `Promise.all` over a mapped array of `sendEmail` promises.

```json
{
  "pr": "evals/pr/03-notify.diff",
  "verdict": "request_changes",
  "issues": [
    {
      "file": "src/notify.js",
      "severity": "high",
      "issue": "Async forEach does not await sendEmail calls, leading to premature markNotified and uncaught errors.",
      "suggestion": "Collect promises with users.map and await Promise.all before calling markNotified."
    }
  ]
}
```
